  "prefLabel": "Rev 1701.06 Expense(s)",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 1701.06 \"Expense(s)\" means charges incurred, whether paid or unpaid, for operations, maintenance, interest, and other charges, including depreciation, presumed to benefit the current fiscal period.\n\nSource. #13489, eff 11-15-22 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Rev 1700)",
